    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p21_b1",
      "text": "Two practical points deserve a final discussion: how much extra computation DRRO\nintroduces on top of GRPO, and why the \u21131 ambiguity set is the geometry that makes\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.58,
        100.15,
